<h2>Segment 217 &mdash; the stream and the basis for seeds</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s217S">&#x27;o na <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w1">&#x27;jug &#x27;grel</span> las, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w2">sems</span> kyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w3">rgyun</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w4">bag chags</span> kyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w5">gzhir</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w6">gsungs pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217x1">ji ltar</span> yin zhe na, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w7">nga</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w8">tsam</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217x2">de nyid</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w9">sems</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w10">rnam shes</span> la brten nas <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w11">btags pa</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w12">rgyud</span> yin pas, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w13">sems</span> kyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w14">rgyud</span> ces <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s217w15">kyang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w16">bya</span> la, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w17">sems</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s217w18">nyid</span> kyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w19">rigs <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s217w20">&#x27;dra</span></span> la de&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w21">rgyud</span> ces pa ltar na, de <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s217w22">yang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w23">res &#x27;ga&#x27; ba</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w24">bag chags</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w25">sgo ba</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w26">gzhir</span> &#x27;gyur ro</span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s217S">One may ask the following: The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w1">autocommentary to Entering the Middle Way</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w6">states</span> that the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w3">stream</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w2">mind</span> is the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w5">basis</span> where the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w4">mental seeds</span> are planted. <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217x1">How</span> does this fit into what you have just said? The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217x2">very thing</span> we call the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w8">simple</span> &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w7">me</span>&quot; is something which results from a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w11">label</span> being applied to the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w9">mind</span>, or <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w10">consciousness</span>. It also goes on in a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w12">stream</span>. From this point of view then we can <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s217w15">also</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w16">refer</span> to it as the &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w14">stream</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w13">mind</span>.&quot; And even if what you mean by a &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w21">stream</span>&quot; is the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w19">continuation of later, <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s217w20">similar</span> instances</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w17">mind</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s217w18">itself</span>, you can say that it <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s217w22">too</span> is the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w26">basis</span> which is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w25">stained</span> by <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w24">mental seeds</span> of particular <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s217w23">occasions</span>.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex from two independently replayed proposals. The direct HGM rigs 'dra gloss includes continuation of later, similar instances; this source-specific compound is retained with the tighter 'dra/similar member, while the stream anaphor remains a separate rgyud occurrence. btags pa takes the tighter HGM-attested label; being applied and the brten nas causal framing remain distributed. ji ltar/How and pronominal de nyid/very thing have direct exponents. res 'ga' ba takes occasions; particular remains unwrapped. gzhir retains its bound terminative while basis alone is paired. Supplied participants, articles, planted and unatomized explanatory grammar remain unwrapped; no uncertainty is encoded as a null. This records corpus attestation and does not alter hgm_gloss.</div>
